    "Summary": "Deterministic two-layer monster AI: a pressure director paces tension, an agent decides what the monster does.",
    "Description": "Deterministic two-layer monster AI for pursuers, stalkers and other hostile creatures, inspired by the two-brains design of Alien: Isolation. Add the Two-Brain Monster AI component with a monster driver and scatter nav node, ingress, offstage region and target markers, or drive TwoBrainsSystem from code with your own world snapshots. Your game keeps entities, navigation, animation and combat; the library only returns decisions. Contains no Creative Assembly code or assets.",
    "WebsiteUrl": "https://github.com/zeljkovranjes/sbox-two-brain-director",
